Pi (packages/coding-agent)
https://github.com/earendil-works/pi
Release v1.1.0, revision abe508e1b89912adde45528136c3221eb69acdd7.
Ported: the session manager (src/core/session-manager.ts), the session
working-directory checks (src/core/session-cwd.ts), the coding-agent message
types and converters (src/core/messages.ts), the path helpers the session
manager uses (src/utils/paths.ts), Pi's UUIDv7 generator
(packages/ai/src/utils/uuid.ts), and the session-manager tests under test/;
tool-output truncation and accumulation (src/core/tools/truncate.ts, output-accumulator.ts), exclusive
output files (src/utils/output-files.ts), and the output cases of
test/tools.test.ts and test/mcp-extension.test.ts.
